# `scripts/` — Deliberate operator commands

## Authority

The root [`README.md`](../README.md) contract distinguishes these CLIs from
Snakemake adapters in `workflow/scripts/`. Root and local
[`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md) files govern mutations.

Use this directory for commands a person deliberately invokes to operate the
repository: initialize data versioning, register and archive a completed run,
create a lab-notebook entry stub, or freeze a reporting delivery. These commands
may coordinate repository boundaries and therefore do not belong in `src/`.

Do not put Snakemake-only adapters here; those belong in `workflow/scripts/`.
Do not hide a required operator action inside an import or ordinary pipeline
rule. Each command must document its inputs, outputs, idempotence, failure
behavior, and whether it needs human approval.
